cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproducibility package, please cite this software release and the associated manuscript."
title: "E2Q: Calibration-Weighted Two-Qubit Exposure for Screening Noise Sensitivity in Variational Quantum Classifiers - Reproducibility Package"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for E2Q, a calibration-weighted two-qubit exposure proxy
  for screening noise-induced probability distortion in variational quantum classifiers.
  The release contains the full benchmark notebook, frozen processed evidence tables,
  calibration provenance, benchmark configuration, figures, and integrity checks.
authors:
